Subject: [PATCH] spi: ingenic: complete DMA transfers from the transmit callback
Upstream-Status: Pending

Attach spi_ingenic_finalize_transfer to the DMA_MEM_TO_DEV descriptor
instead of the DMA_DEV_TO_MEM descriptor.

diff --git a/drivers/spi/spi-ingenic.c b/drivers/spi/spi-ingenic.c
index f9d402daf8590ea3434890ff945a1f1a557613c2..44535539f1e1497098401415edc7bf5e58d7d4e5 100644
--- a/drivers/spi/spi-ingenic.c
+++ b/drivers/spi/spi-ingenic.c
@@ -166,7 +166,7 @@ spi_ingenic_prepare_dma(struct spi_controller *ctlr, struct dma_chan *chan,
 	if (!desc)
 		return ERR_PTR(-ENOMEM);
 
-	if (dir == DMA_DEV_TO_MEM) {
+	if (dir == DMA_MEM_TO_DEV) {
 		desc->callback = spi_ingenic_finalize_transfer;
 		desc->callback_param = ctlr;
 	}
